            <abstract>
                <p>Divinatory text (ḥassāb) concerning the stars normally composed of twelve chapters corresponding to the twelve signs of the 
                    zodiac and similar to <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7111Zodiac">Astrological treatise on the twelve signs of the zodiac</ref>, <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT5048Hassabat#Stars">Ḥassābāt: Calculus of stars (ሐሳበ፡ ከዋክብት፡)</ref>
                    and <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7107Divination#kawakebt">Treatise on divination: ሐሳበ፡ ከዋክብት፡ ወመናዝል፡</ref>. To be used, when no further information can be retrieved.</p>
